# [GREEN](../wg/green.html)

## Summary

The GREEN Working Group met at IETF 127. The session covered progress on core WG deliverables, including framework, device, and controller YANG data models, capability discovery, provenance, API specifications, hackathon implementation results, and external proposals.

Key highlights included:
* Welcome to Marisol Palmero as the new Working Group Secretary.
* Progress updates on active working group drafts: `draft-ietf-green-framework` and `draft-ietf-green-power-and-energy-yang`.
* Presentation and updates on candidate individual drafts: `draft-swepcarl-green-controller-yang`, `draft-claise-green-capability-discovery`, `draft-madpr-green-provenance`, and `draft-petra-green-api-05`.
* Results and live demonstration from the IETF 127 Hackathon testing device-level YANG models across use cases.
* Presentation on `draft-cowlishaw-carbontxt` and discussion on its scope and potential home within the IETF.

